{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Refresh replay logs after terminal completion**\n\nFor the `replay` scenario, `wait_returns` normally stops at the first `PENDING` return. `Cloud.finish()` polls only the durable API and never refreshes CloudWatch, so `trace` remains stale and `assert_replay` reports no resume even after successful completion. Poll for the final `SUCCEEDED` wrapper return before reading the trace, and cover this warm-replay path in a unit test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc703gOy","finding_digest":"abf668d52da50310c8d0aa144251a624976d16b1ba0991629b91eef66ebc8697","finding_id":"arf_v1_vp3grvjnuubrbsgqvikeeunges","finding_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::warm_case::replay-log-evidence-freshness","identity_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::warm_case::replay-log-evidence-freshness","line":576,"observation_digest":"65207a59f0e7afd6a20cf7ada0ad85223babd8489968f6afbc5ae38cd35d3354","observation_id":"aro_v1_muqhuwpq46x5niqm66w2blmfei","path":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T20:03:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4g3gjtfg4uz66bh74knsmw5pvh","reviewed_base_sha":"518cba16e0e690e1939feff222915ce841aa960b","reviewed_head_sha":"b36047acb3afdd294ad3421e751071036c76a47d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":575,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":728},"record_id":"art_v1_jpiszaeuekx63trcuvzkcdxdis","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T20:03:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
